    P(STATION, INTL, 2, 2000, 11, 2, "Expedition 1", "Shepherd, Gidzenko and Krikalev move in. Someone has been living in orbit ever since."),
    S(STATION, CHN, 3, 2011, 9, 29, 2018, 4, 2, "Tiangong-1", "A single-module testbed for docking and short stays, visited by two crews."),
